WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.374
Your work matters only if people understand it, and act on it.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.254
Start with the answer, in one or two sentences.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.112
Show one or two key numbers, and one clear chart.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.370
Say what people should do next.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.582
And be honest about what the data cannot tell you.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:26.729
Before you move on, check: State the answer in one or two sentences. Show one clear chart. Write a recommendation. State the limits of your data.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:32.832
Well done. You have finished the course. Now answer a real question with data.
